    feat(board): DF-BOARDCTL-41 — closed -> complete read alias
    
    - StatusAliases gains closed -> complete: every live 'closed' row observed on
      a real fleet board carried terminal-success evidence; the value is no
      longer ambiguous in practice (decision recorded on row DF-BOARDCTL-41)
    - write path unchanged: create/update still reject closed (write checks the
      canonical vocabulary, not the alias table) — proven by test
    - normalize-board / update --normalize / sweep-status now convert closed
    - README + doc comments updated; full gate suite green
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
